<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Tell the sweet story of Christ and His love,</l><l>Tell of His pow’r to forgive;</l><l>Others will trust Him if only you prove</l><l>True, every moment you live.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Give as ’twas given to you in your need,</l><l>Love as the Master loved you;</l><l>Be to the helpless a helper indeed,</l><l>Unto your mission be true.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
